        <mxCell id="erd-legend" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:16px;line-height:1.2;white-space:normal;&quot;&gt;PK = primary key; FK = declared foreign key; both labels mark a composite-key member that is also a foreign key. Parent end: mandatory one for NOT NULL FK, optional zero-or-one for nullable FK. Child end: zero-to-many. No inferred links: quizzes.topic_id, sync_revisions scope/entity columns, and hub_meta have no declared FK relationships. Pins, keys and Hub storage paths are listed because this is the Hub master schema, not a client payload. Protected accounts, classrooms and graded records are retained through deactivation or archiving; SQL CASCADE clauses do not authorize their deletion.&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=16;" vertex="1" parent="1" kind="note">
